      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NASANA NZ (12) extended her winning streak with another strong performance at Riverina Paceway, scoring by 3 metres over 1740m. The wide draw makes this tougher, but she is in undeniable form, and we have her winning again. WEONA MISS MIKI (2) returned from a spell with a solid third here over 1609m and should take plenty of improvement from that run. The front-line draw is a major plus and she looks the main danger. PETES CRUNCH TIME (3) is racing well and he has the speed to fully utilize this draw if his drivers chooses to do so early on. Stick with him on an each-way basis. WICKED WIZARD (10) was an impressive last start winner from well off the pace here 2 weeks ago, and BETTERLIGHTEM UP (1) drawn the pole, are both worth including in all combos.",
